  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Wash and dry raspberries. Place in a medium bowl along with honey and cinnamon. Using a fork or potato masher, gently crush the raspberries until they reach a chunky, jam-like consistency. Set aside."
    },
    {
      "text": "Roughly chop pistachios."
    },
    {
      "text": "To serve, divide yogurt between bowls. Top with crushed raspberries, then swirl with the yogurt using a spoon. Sprinkle with pistachios and enjoy!"
    }
